const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文提出用公司特征刻画时变因子暴露与条件协方差结构，从而统一风险和收益建模。 阅读时应将其放回原始样本、时点和制度环境中理解，不能把问题本身当作跨市场结论。",en:"The article develops a framework in which firm characteristics help model time-varying factor exposures and the conditional covariance structure underlying risk and return. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2019.05.001",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"它把特征面板与潜在因子结构连接，特征定义、标准化、因子维度、协方差估计和时间变化共同构成模型合同。 比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系共同构成研究合同；改变其中任一选择，可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It links characteristic panels to latent factor structure, making the characteristic definitions, normalization, factor dimension, covariance estimator, and time variation part of the model contract. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2019.05.001",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"需要时点一致的收益、带日期的公司特征、市场和因子数据、样本成员、退市历史、标准化规则和训练验证测试的时间顺序。 字段定义、可得时点和样本筛选必须与原研究分开记录，不能因变量同名或使用最新修订值便视为可比。",en:"A comparable study needs point-in-time returns, dated firm characteristics, market and factor data, universe membership, delisting history, normalization rules, and train-validation-test chronology. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2019.05.001",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"论文提供风险收益统一建模视角，并不说明单个观测特征具有独立因果溢价或可移植信号意义。 它只支持来源描述的经验或理论关系，不能把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"The paper provides a unified risk-and-return modeling perspective; it does not say that an observed characteristic has a standalone causal premium or is a portable signal. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not turn association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2019.05.001",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"记录特征滞后与变换；保留缺失和退市规则；最终测试前固定因子维度；区分样本内拟合和验证；对比明确基准模型。 开展后续分析前，应将这些选择写入版本化研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Document characteristic lags and transformations; preserve missing and delisting rules; fix factor dimension before final testing; distinguish in-sample fit from validation; and compare against explicit benchmark models. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2019.05.001",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 Journal of Financial Economics · DOI record。某个模型和样本推断的条件协方差不是可观测真值，也不是当前投资建议。 如需数值结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites Journal of Financial Economics · DOI record. Conditional covariances inferred by one model and sample are not observable truths or current investment recommendations. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2019.05.001",label:{zh:"Journal of Financial Economics · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Financial Economics · DOI record · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“Characteristics Are Covariances: A Unified Model of Risk and Return”公开说明的研究对象、设计与适用边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。某个模型和样本推断的条件协方差不是可观测真值，也不是当前投资建议。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “Characteristics Are Covariances: A Unified Model of Risk and Return”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
